{"description": "The underlying dataset for this Enhanced Vegetation Index (EVI)\nproduct is MODIS BRDF-corrected imagery (MCD43B4), which was gap-filled\nusing the approach outlined in Weiss et al. (2014) to eliminate missing\ndata caused by factors such as cloud cover. Gap-free outputs were then\naggregated temporally and spatially to produce the monthly &asymp;5km product.\n\nThis dataset was produced by Harry Gibson and Daniel Weiss of the\nMalaria Atlas Project (Big Data Institute, University of Oxford,\nUnited Kingdom, [https://malariaatlas.org/](https://malariaatlas.org/)).\n", "extent": {"spatial": {"bbox": [[-180, -90, 180, 90]]}, "temporal": {"interval": [["2001-02-01T00:00:00Z", "2015-06-01T00:00:00Z"]]}}, "gee:categories": ["vegetation-indices"], "gee:interval": {"interval": 1, "type": "cadence", "unit": "month"}, "gee:status": "deprecated", "gee:terms_of_use": "[CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0](https://spdx.org/licenses/CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.html)", "gee:type": "image_collection", "gee:unusual_terms_of_use": true, "id": "Oxford/MAP/EVI_5km_Monthly", "keywords": ["evi", "map", "oxford", "vegetation", "vegetation-indices"], "license": "CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0", "links": [{"href": "https://storage.googleapis.com/earthengine-stac/catalog/Oxford/Oxford_MAP_EVI_5km_Monthly.json", "rel": "self", "type": "application/json"}, {"href": "https://storage.googleapis.com/earthengine-stac/catalog/Oxford/catalog.json", "rel": "parent", "type": "application/json"}, {"href": "https://storage.googleapis.com/earthengine-stac/catalog/catalog.json", "rel": "root", "type": "application/json"}, {"code": "JavaScript", "href": "https://code.earthengine.google.com/?scriptPath=Examples:Datasets/Oxford/Oxford_MAP_EVI_5km_Monthly", "rel": "related", "title": "Run the example for Oxford/MAP/EVI_5km_Monthly in the Earth Engine Code Editor", "type": "text/html"}, {"href": "https://developers.google.com/earth-engine/datasets/images/Oxford/Oxford_MAP_EVI_5km_Monthly_sample.png", "rel": "preview", "type": "image/png"}